#################################################################
#    Annotations
#################################################################

:Algorithm <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A finite, well-defined specification of operations executable on a computational substrate."@en ;
           rdfs:label "Algorithm"@en .


:Bayesian_Optimization <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Search Strategy* that selects configurations by means of a probabilistic surrogate balancing exploration and exploitation."@en ;
                        rdfs:label "Bayesian Optimization"@en .


:CPU <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Hardware Device* specialization denoting general-purpose processing units employed as the substrate of an experiment."@en ;
      rdfs:label "CPU"@en .


:Candidate_Architecture <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A role played by a *Neural Network* when it is created within the *NAS Experiment*, evaluated by the *Performance Estimation Strategy*, and characterized by the *Neural Network Metrics* quality."@en ;
                         rdfs:label "Candidate Architecture"@en .


:Core <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A processing unit that is a component of a *Hardware Device* (`is_component_of`)."@en ;
       rdfs:label "Core"@en .


:Data <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An informational resource consumable by computational procedures during a search run."@en ;
      rdfs:label "Data"@en .


:Dataset <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An informational resource that figures as a member of *Data* (`is_collection_member_of`), participates in the *NAS Experiment*, and bears the *Structured* quality."@en ;
          rdfs:label "Dataset"@en .


:Evolutionary_Algorithms <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Search Strategy* that explores the search space through population-based selection-and-mutation mechanisms."@en ;
                          rdfs:label "Evolutionary Algorithms"@en .


:Final_Architecture <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A role played by a *Neural Network* when it is created and selected as the outcome of the *NAS Experiment*."@en ;
                     rdfs:label "Final Architecture"@en .


:GPU <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Hardware Device* specialization denoting massively parallel processing units used to accelerate training and evaluation."@en ;
      rdfs:label "GPU"@en .


:Gradient_Based <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Search Strategy* that relaxes the discrete search space into a differentiable one explored via gradient-driven optimization."@en ;
                rdfs:label "Gradient Based"@en .


:Hardware_Device <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A physical device that provides the material substrate supporting execution, participates in the *NAS Experiment*, has *Core* and *Memory* components, and bears its operational qualities."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Hardware Device"@en .


:Hyperparameters <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A configuration category representing the configurable, non-learned attributes of a model, specializing into *Neural Network Hyperparameters* and *Layer Hyperparameters*."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Hyperparameters"@en .


:Hyperparameters_Structure <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An organized space of admissible hyperparameter configurations that defines the structure of *Hyperparameters* (`defines_structure_of`) and is materialized by the *Search Space*."@en ;
                            rdfs:label "Hyperparameters Structure"@en .


:Hyperparameters_Value <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A concrete value (*quale*) in the quality structure of *Layer Hyperparameters*, associated via the `has_reified_quality_value` relation."@en ;
                        rdfs:label "Hyperparameters Value"@en .


:Initial_System_Configuration <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An initial situation capturing the pre-state necessity of a system for a trained network, which contributes to trigger (`contributed_to_triggers`) the *NAS Experiment*."@en ;
                              rdfs:label "Initial System Configuration"@en .


:Layer <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A structural unit that is a mereological component of a *Neural Network* (`is_component_of`) and bears its own configurable hyperparameters (*Layer Hyperparameters*)."@en ;
        rdfs:label "Layer"@en .


:Layer_Hyperparameters <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Hyperparameters* specialization inhering in a *Layer* that specifies configurable architectural characteristics of that layer (e.g., number of units, kernel size, stride, activation function), whose assigned value is externalized through the `has_reified_quality_value` relation."@en ;
                        rdfs:label "Layer Hyperparameters"@en .


:Memory <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A storage component of a *Hardware Device* (`is_component_of`) that bears the *Memory Capacity* quality."@en ;
        rdfs:label "Memory"@en .


:Memory_Capacity <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An intrinsic quality inhering in a *Memory* component that quantifies its storage capacity."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Memory Capacity"@en .


:NAS_Experiment <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A perdurant representing the temporally bounded execution of a NAS run, triggered by an initial situation (*Initial System Configuration*) and resulting in a finished-experiment situation (*The experiment has finished*), aggregating the participations of its substantials."@en ;
                 rdfs:label "NAS Experiment"@en .


:Neural_Network <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An artificial neural architecture composed of *Layer* components that bears the *Neural Network Hyperparameters* quality, produced in the course of a *NAS Experiment*."@en ;
                 rdfs:label "Neural Network"@en .


:Neural_Network_Hyperparameters <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Hyperparameters* specialization inhering in a *Neural Network*, representing its configurable, non-learned attributes."@en ;
                                 rdfs:label "Neural Network Hyperparameters"@en .


:Neural_Network_Metrics <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An intrinsic quality inhering in a *Candidate Architecture* that measures its observed performance, produced by the *Performance Estimation Strategy* (`produces`)."@en ;
                         rdfs:label "Neural Network Metrics"@en .


:Operating_Frequency <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An intrinsic quality inhering in a *Hardware Device* that measures the clock rate at which it operates."@en ;
                      rdfs:label "Operating Frequency"@en .


:Performance_Estimation_Strategy <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An *Algorithm* that estimates the quality of candidate architectures, monitors search progress, and *produces* the *Neural Network Metrics*."@en ;
                                  rdfs:label "Performance Esimation Strategy"@en .


:Random_Search <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Search Strategy* that samples architectures uniformly at random from the search space."@en ;
                rdfs:label "Random Search"@en .


:Reinforcement_Learning <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A *Search Strategy* that frames architectural decisions as sequential agent actions optimizing a reward signal derived from candidate performance."@en ;
                         rdfs:label "Reinforcement Learning"@en .


:Search_Space <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A substantial entity that materializes the *Hyperparameters Structure* (`materializes`) to delimit the admissible configurations to be explored, participating in the *NAS Experiment*."@en ;
               rdfs:label "Search Space"@en .


:Search_Strategy <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An *Algorithm* that governs the exploration of a search space, proposing and traversing candidate configurations."@en ;
                  rdfs:label "Search Strategy"@en .


:Structure <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An intrinsic quality inhering in a *Dataset* that characterizes the organization of its samples, whose possible values (structured, semi-structured, unstructured) are qualia in its quality structure."@en ;
            rdfs:label "Structure"@en .


:The_Experiment_Finished <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A post-state situation brought about (`brought_about`) by the completion of the *NAS Experiment*."@en ;
                         rdfs:label "The Experiment Finished"@en .


